        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12899.txt",
        "text_sha256": "4338f02e9134e4c2d0f535e0cef1b0d6943f3f258246a752998b4c4499720eab",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1994-02-17/pdf/FR-1994-02-17.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishm ent o f the Board. There is established, effective February  \n15, 1994, a board of three members to be appointed by the President to  \ninvestigate this dispute. No member shall be interested pecuniarily or other­\nwise in any organization of railroad employees or any carrier. The board  \nshall perform its functions subject to the availability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2481,
      "char_start": 2130,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12899#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 231,
      "scope_id": "EO:12899#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "59 FR 8113, PDF pages 231-231",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "f6a9f0719ce6db5c3fa28164eb34e56801d748cb8d6e8dbbfbda14368da85e1a",
        "signing_date": "1994-02-15",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12899.txt",
        "text_sha256": "4338f02e9134e4c2d0f535e0cef1b0d6943f3f258246a752998b4c4499720eab",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1994-02-17/pdf/FR-1994-02-17.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report . Within 30 days after creation of the board, the parties to  \nthe dispute shall submit to the board final offers for settlement of the  \ndispute. Within 30 days after submission of final offers for settlement of  \nthe dispute, the board shall submit a report to the President setting forth  \nits selection of the most reasonable offer."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2768,
      "char_start": 2482,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12899#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 231,
      "scope_id": "EO:12899#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "59 FR 8113, PDF pages 231-231",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "f6a9f0719ce6db5c3fa28164eb34e56801d748cb8d6e8dbbfbda14368da85e1a",
        "signing_date": "1994-02-15",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12899.txt",
        "text_sha256": "4338f02e9134e4c2d0f535e0cef1b0d6943f3f258246a752998b4c4499720eab",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1994-02-17/pdf/FR-1994-02-17.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. M aintaining Conditions.  As provided by section 9A(h) of the Act,  \nfrom the time a request to establish a board is made until 60 days after  \nthe board makes its report, the parties shall make no changes in the conditions  \nout of which the dispute arose, except by agreement."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2955,
      "char_start": 2769,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12899#sec4",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 4.",
      "pdf_page": 231,
      "scope_id": "EO:12899#sec4",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "59 FR 8113, PDF pages 231-231",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "f6a9f0719ce6db5c3fa28164eb34e56801d748cb8d6e8dbbfbda14368da85e1a",
        "signing_date": "1994-02-15",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12899.txt",
        "text_sha256": "4338f02e9134e4c2d0f535e0cef1b0d6943f3f258246a752998b4c4499720eab",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1994-02-17/pdf/FR-1994-02-17.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. Expiration.  The board shall terminate upon submission of the report  \nprovided for in section 2 of this order.\nIFR Doc. 04-3853 \nPiled 2-18-94; 11:06 am] \nBilling code 3195-01-P"
    }
  ],
